WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.970
Your Level 3 learners need their own organiser for every

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.525
lesson, and building those pages each week takes hours.

00:00:08.546 --> 00:00:11.258
62 printable A4 pages.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:17.130
It's for learners aged 10 to 12 (CEFR A2 to B1) following Level

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.903
3 Expansion with a teacher or tutor.

00:00:20.906 --> 00:00:23.356
190,000 dong per learner.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:26.456
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

